"id":"m_a35c14797fda1ddc6d0e","expressionId":"x_0ac8a60d13e452a89833","language":"ja","text":"【句動】引っ込める,ひきもどす / 後退する,撤退する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_05513a36069f5b1f786d","expressionId":"x_840a459982c431b964d7","language":"ja","text":"【句動】を元の場所に戻す,引き返す","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_ca59a4b1ed577d9e2952","expressionId":"x_bead11588ac2eba763c0","language":"ja","text":"《新しいことを》始める,話し合う《to ...》 / 《 ...に》移動する, 《...に》引っ越す《to ...》 / 先に進む / 〈話題など〉変える, 先に進む /  （辛い経験を乗り越えて）精神的に前に進む","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_ddcba02f05b9ff19c191","expressionId":"x_a4b5d8a008e92af2f0d5","language":"ja","text":"【句動】閉鎖する,廃業する,終了する, を閉鎖する,を終了する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_59fcec15fbf296ce15b1","expressionId":"x_d69d3e49705edcbe3eb0","language":"ja","text":"一列に並ぶ,行列をつくる,を整列させる,を並べる,《...に合わせて》をきちんと揃える《with ...》 / (位置を)調整する / 準備する / (仕事などを) 確保する, 手配する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_5beb89079bf403b2948c","expressionId":"x_383d6966920ca54cba09","language":"ja","text":"【句動】に着手する,に取り組み始める","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_e3938bfd2e035c1d01c7","expressionId":"x_b4a9f51fee942f7a99bd","language":"ja","text":"【句動】を完済する / 実を結ぶ,報われる","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_9fea34f4765461ba3a3f","expressionId":"x_90e5246021b9b2362e30","language":"ja","text":"《a thing ~ 》一つか二つのこと, ちょっとしたこと, 多少のこと","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_347526b754ed2a26a441","expressionId":"x_16b97feff74c08357eb4","language":"ja","text":"《話》...など, ...といったようなもの / その類いのこと","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_bd2ce434e30d6e829a1b","expressionId":"x_813e1611820938bf6730","language":"ja","text":"《書》【形】次の, 後に続く / 次に述べる, 下記の","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_1922ea3532f847049c47","expressionId":"x_ec153694483b2b7d1ccc","language":"ja","text":"を設置する / を用意する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_3e564e7feceb917f0e2a","expressionId":"x_aa572b28f43faac6dff6","language":"ja","text":"そちらに, そちらで, あそこに, あそこで / その国に,その国で","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_0846a91d8e4c5a0196cb","expressionId":"x_1ab0107e951a25478ad9","language":"ja","text":"（同じ文書･ページ中で）上記のこと, 上述のこと","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_ec6a6bf55651600afa93","expressionId":"x_3e384209f3a571e39474","language":"ja","text":"《be ~ 》いまだ...されない","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_33ea466dbb9877ddba6e","expressionId":"x_b4031fe58e6d325d0823","language":"ja","text":"【形】だめな / 役に立たない【名/C】《くだけて》 だめな人,だめなもの / 役立たず,能無し","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_d04f34f56ee4e253cb06","expressionId":"x_df22dea494ee3f6de305","language":"ja","text":"《be ~》（長期間慣れ親しんで）...が大好きである, ...が大変気に入っている / 《be ~ doing》...するのが大好きである, しばしば...する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_df2bd8e576f893005008","expressionId":"x_d193d7f0d62fecb46840","language":"ja","text":"...がある","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_c32506209c59e1ef05e3","expressionId":"x_fdcf6ae549cbc281158d","language":"ja","text":"を見分ける,を聞き分ける / を理解する  /  進展する / イチャイチャする","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_b01a1f8b634f720e4028","expressionId":"x_8b64be9d5997d5a83315","language":"ja","text":"昨夜, 昨晩","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_7824dbfdf9c9976c190e","expressionId":"x_9c8dade5f4ebdb69139d","language":"ja","text":"《最大限》最大で....まで / 《期間・程度》...までずっと / 《be ~ 》《 …するのは》（人）次第である,（人）の責任である《do》 / ...に従事して / ...をたくらんで","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_b63c8bb8beefeb838404","expressionId":"x_2c9f6f9e513d32555fa6","language":"ja","text":"（客観的判断として）...しなければならない / （指示して）...してください / ...であるに違いない","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_785c9231cf525a3a7ab2","expressionId":"x_d8917ae9a95797bfabfc","language":"ja","text":"...を条件として, （条件）を満たした場合に限り / 【形】《be ~》（良くないこと）の影響を受けやすい / （条件･規則）に従わねばならない /  （審理など）を受けねばならない","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_3f9127a863220eb91b63","expressionId":"x_935768f78ea9ed3b3f3f","language":"ja","text":"《結果》結局は,やっぱり / 《理由》だって…だから, なにしろ...だから","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_fe84e11f56f46856aaa8","expressionId":"x_297529e7516fba41fbce","language":"ja","text":"《ぼかし表現》ちょっと, まあ何て言うか, 言ってみれば / （あいまいな答えとして）まあね","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_1bf2c753e1adca09f6c6","expressionId":"x_3139443d1259d0d1c954","language":"ja","text":"（提案・勧誘・依頼を表して）...はどうですか / （意見・感想・説明を求めて）...についてはどうお考えですか","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_dc6708a5fc41400217e0","expressionId":"x_ac01fd23bf6517195d29","language":"ja","text":"《言い換え》言い換えれば / 《推論結果》つまり（…ということだ）","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_5fc1c4e96bad9e3fdaa2","expressionId":"x_f80ce9e7d8940b27620a","language":"ja","text":"これまで, 今まで, 現在までのところ","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_7ef3e379a4667a720884","expressionId":"x_cc2c00916d8e07a554f3","language":"ja","text":"（物・事）から判断して, ...を考慮して","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_59b556ca2887a76e1cde","expressionId":"x_9be229f761256029b8bb","language":"ja","text":"を掲げる / （良い状態で）持ちこたえる / を遅らせる,を阻む / 強盗する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_c28503154398b6f4a469","expressionId":"x_c90de754ed745fb884be","language":"ja","text":"第一人称(英語ではIとwe;話し手が自分を指していう語)","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_1f2cd1f117bcd24cd428","expressionId":"x_5b87de02aa741b042511","language":"ja","text":"(名に対する)姓","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_d5ee2cb2fa076ef09f9e","expressionId":"x_2aaeafe0d5ee409d6b58","language":"ja","text":"〈C〉〈U〉鉱泉,鉱水 / 〈U〉《英》炭酸水,清涼飲料","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_979635117b4369fbea0b","expressionId":"x_34d7399635770491c739","language":"ja","text":"〈C〉(交差点の)交通信号灯","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_30e0a6657a158c9f4b9e","expressionId":"x_77d88943c0b4f00ffe6e","language":"ja","text":"(窮状などを救う)解決法 / 《英》(劇場などの)出口(exit)","source":"EJDict"}]